{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10283300","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10283300","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1028330001:1":{"text":"は、はくしょいっ！な、なんだこの刺激臭は！？","source_cn":"阿——嚏！什么味道……太刺鼻了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x606B14483ABB989B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028330002:1":{"text":"あれ……みんな、僕をじっと見てどうしたんだい？","source_cn":"呃……你们怎么这么看着我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26ACDEB04ADC02E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028330003:1":{"text":"ガリ！良かった！やっと目が覚めたんですね！","source_cn":"伽利！太好了！你终于醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2A9CF605916A91C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028330004:1":{"text":"僕は……霊薬を飲んだあと……あれ？何だか頭がクラクラする。まるで夜中に突然起こされたような感覚だ……","source_cn":"我……刚才不是喝了灵药吗？怎么……有点头晕，像是睡到半...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0E42856B35D68B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1028330004":{"text":"僕は……霊薬を飲んだあと……あれ？何だか頭がクラクラする。まるで夜中に突然起こされたような感覚だ……","source_cn":"我……刚才不是喝了灵药吗？怎么……有点头晕，像是睡到半夜被突然叫醒一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0E42856B35D68B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028330005:1":{"text":"でも、僕が飲んだのは永遠の若さを保つ霊薬のはずじゃ……いったいどういうこと？","source_cn":"但我喝的不是永葆青春的灵药吗？到底是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC99BBD4F636AEA01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028330006:0":{"text":"何から説明すればいいか……","source_cn":"该怎么说呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC958EB64D5A9CF03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1028330006":{"text":"何から説明すればいいか……","source_cn":"该怎么说呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC958EB64D5A9CF03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028330009:1":{"text":"なんだって？つまり、人を眠らせることで「永遠の若さ」を保たせていたと？","source_cn":"什么？你是说，它用沉睡不醒的方式来让人“永葆青春”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C217BD86F45F68E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028330010:1":{"text":"はっ！それが若さ！？\n情熱も、追い求めるものもなく、動かずに眠っているだけの若さだって！？","source_cn":"哈，青春！\\n——没有激情、没有追求，一动不动睡在那里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC87C031B5AB8F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028330011:1":{"text":"だった